{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/extras/5e4c75c775d54e310899849f458ec359.poster.avif?t=1773761921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/extras/5e4c75c775d54e310899849f458ec359.webm?t=1773761921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/extras/e79e61b5c04f2434188dc61efbb5b650.poster.avif?t=1773761921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/extras/e79e61b5c04f2434188dc61efbb5b650.webm?t=1773761921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Horror Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a 3rd-person survival horror action game across 3 story-driven acts, offering tens of hours of gameplay with three difficulty modes to choose from.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Inventory Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With scarce resources and tight inventory space, every decision matters - making every bullet count can mean the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Garment Crafting &amp; Repair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repairing and crafting garments isn\u2019t just cosmetic - it\u2019s essential to survival, adding a unique strategic layer to the horror experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deadly Hide-and-Seek</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Act 2, face a special challenge where brute force won\u2019t work. Outsmart towering bosses in tense hide-and-seek encounters, relying on sharp judgment and quick decisions to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game embraces a sensual atmosphere, but its core focus is survival horror gameplay rather than explicit nudity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/extras/71ce6dacd71809cfe2daf14ede638ce5.poster.avif?t=1773761921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/extras/71ce6dacd71809cfe2daf14ede638ce5.webm?t=1773761921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/extras/ae3f4ae82558035f0aa1ae66c2f2d001.poster.avif?t=1773761921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/extras/ae3f4ae82558035f0aa1ae66c2f2d001.webm?t=1773761921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The World Turns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966070/81e64751bf094a9ec20a480819c48cbd2f66e993.jpg"},{"name":"First Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966070/e17c91b9d83e23d89504b2e3fe76bf85a9c5e938.jpg"},{"name":"A Small Favor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966070/f8035b27edd1fee7aab030f7a6c8c5836303c044.jpg"},{"name":"Main St. Bound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966070/8